assets/catalog.json contains a small public DM5 metadata snapshot for the
explicitly labelled sample shelf. The repository does not bundle comic cover
or chapter image files. Images displayed by the client are fetched from DM5's
CDN and remain the property of their respective rights holders. These images
and source metadata are not covered by the application's MIT license.

The DM5 adapter reads public pages and decodes embedded image-list data through
string substitution. It does not execute remote JavaScript or include account
credentials. Login-gated or otherwise unavailable chapters may require the
original website. This project is not affiliated with DM5.
